flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> A[Evidence submitted by AI engine or authorized user]
    A --> B[Authenticate requester or trusted service]
    B --> C{Authorized to submit evidence?}
    C -- No --> D[Record denied submission]
    D --> END([End])
    C -- Yes --> E[Validate file, metadata and incident reference]
    E --> F{Validation successful?}
    F -- No --> G[Reject package and record failure]
    G --> END
    F -- Yes --> H[Scan for malware and corruption]
    H --> I{File safe and readable?}
    I -- No --> J[Quarantine file and create security alert]
    J --> K[Write audit event]
    K --> END
    I -- Yes --> L[Generate evidence identifier]
    L --> M[Calculate original SHA-256 hash]
    M --> N[Create evidence manifest]
    N --> O[Generate AES-256 data key]
    O --> P[Encrypt evidence with AES-256-GCM]
    P --> Q[Wrap data key with RSA or KMS]
    Q --> R[Digitally sign evidence manifest]
    R --> S[Upload encrypted object to S3 or MinIO]
    S --> T{Upload successful?}
    T -- No --> U[Record failure and queue retry]
    U --> K
    T -- Yes --> V[Persist metadata, hashes, key reference and storage URI]
    V --> W[Create initial chain-of-custody record]
    W --> X[Link evidence to incident]
    X --> Y[Write immutable ingestion audit event]
    Y --> Z[Return evidence ID and success status]
    Z --> END
